5,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"Yay! A game of Werewolf! I'm so excited! Let's all try our best to find the scary wolf, okay? Who do you guys think looks the most suspicious already? Hehe!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Minato,,"It's my first time playing this, so I'm not sure... but everyone seems so happy! I don't think anyone looks suspicious yet. Maybe we can talk more and get to know each other first?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"It's too early to point fingers, Sakura. We need a real plan if we want to win. Let's just keep our cool and see who starts acting weird first.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Mio,,"I agree with Takumi! Let's stay calm. But Sakura's energy is contagious, isn't it? Hehe! I'm super curious to see how everyone plays. Let's just chat for now and see what happens!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,It's far too early for guesswork. Let's just observe. The way people react to the pressure of the first few days usually reveals more than any random accusation. I'll be watching closely.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Sakura,,@Shion sounds so serious! It's like you're a detective! Hehe. But maybe being too quiet is suspicious too? I wonder if the wolf is hiding behind a scary face or a nice smile!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Minato,,"A nice smile... that's a scary thought. I hope everyone is being honest. @Sakura, do you think we can tell who the wolf is just by looking at them? I want to learn how to find the clues!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Minato, you can't just look at them. You have to listen to how they talk and if their stories change. Don't let Sakura's excitement distract you; we need to be sharp.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi is right, we have to be sharp! But @Minato, don't be too scared! I think it'll be like a puzzle. I'm so excited to see who's hiding what! Let's keep talking and find some clues together!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,"@Sakura, calling me a detective is a bit simplistic. I'm simply applying logic. If you're looking for ""scary faces,"" you'll likely be misled. The wolf will be the one trying hardest to blend in.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"Blending in, huh? That sounds like a challenge! Hehe. I'll be watching everyone's smiles very closely then! @Minato, don't be scared, we'll solve this puzzle together! Who else wants to play detective with me?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Minato,,"I'd like to try! It sounds like fun to solve a puzzle with everyone. @Shion, can you teach me how to use logic to find the wolf? I want to be helpful too!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Minato, just stop relying on others to tell you what to do. Think for yourself. If we just follow Shion's ""logic"" without questioning it, we might be walking right into a trap.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi, you're so strict! But you're right, we should all think for ourselves. Still, I think it's okay to help each other out! Let's all try our best to be detectives together! Hehe!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,"@Minato, logic isn't something I can simply ""teach"" in a few sentences; it's about observing contradictions. @Takumi, your skepticism is noted, but questioning everything without a basis is just as inefficient as blind trust.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Sakura,,"Everyone is so serious! Hehe. I'll just keep being my cheerful self and watch you all. I bet the wolf is getting nervous right now! Good luck with your logic, @Shion! Let's see what happens tomorrow!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Minato,,"I hope everyone has a good night. I'll try my best to remember everything we talked about so I can help tomorrow. Good luck, everyone! I'm looking forward to seeing what happens!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"Whatever. Just make sure you're actually paying attention, Minato. I'm going to keep a close eye on everyone. Let's see who's still acting ""nice"" when things get real tomorrow.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
