26,0,4,talk,Shion,,"The first day was merely a warm-up. I've noted everyone's baseline behavior; now we see who falters when the first casualty appears. Sleep well, everyone. I'll be analyzing your words tomorrow.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
