34,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Good morning everyone! Did you all sleep well? I wonder if the scary wolf did something naughty last night... Hehe! I'm so curious! Who do you think is missing, or who's acting weird today?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Minato,,"Good morning, Sakura! I slept okay, but I'm a little nervous now. I hope everyone is still here... @Shion, did you notice anything strange? I want to try and find clues like you said!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"@Minato, stop asking Shion for the answers. If you're actually trying to find clues, look at how everyone is reacting right now. The wolf is probably just waiting for us to start arguing.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Mio,,"Good morning! I'm wide awake and ready! @Minato, don't be so nervous, we're all in this together! I've been thinking about what everyone said yesterday, and I'm super excited to start solving this puzzle! Hehe!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Shion,,"The time for pleasantries is over. We are now in the phase where the Seer has information and the wolf is feeling the pressure. @Minato, stop looking for answers and start looking for inconsistencies. Who seems too eager to deflect?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Shion is always so pushy! Hehe. ""Deflecting,"" huh? That sounds like a big word! Maybe the wolf is the one trying to act like a super-smart teacher to trick us? What do you think, @Mio?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Sakura, that's a scary thought... I didn't think of it that way. But @Shion is just trying to help me learn. Do you think someone could really pretend to be smart just to trick us? I'm getting confused...","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Sakura, you're just throwing random guesses to stir things up. @Minato, don't let her confuse you. Shion's being blunt, but that's not the same as being the wolf. We need to focus on actual evidence, not just ""vibes.""","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Minato"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Sakura, you're so funny! But @Takumi is right, we can't just guess based on vibes. Still, it's interesting how everyone is reacting! I'm wondering if anyone has noticed anything specific yet? Hehe!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Sakura, your attempt to frame my analytical approach as a ""trick"" is a classic diversion. It's a weak play. @Mio, you're playing the observer, but your lack of a concrete opinion is starting to look like caution.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Shion, you're calling me a ""weak play""? That's mean! Hehe. I'm just asking questions! @Mio is just being nice, unlike some people here. Maybe the wolf is just grumpy today? Who's the grumpiest?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Minato,,"@Sakura, please don't fight... I don't want anyone to be mean. @Shion, is being grumpy a clue? I'm trying to look for inconsistencies, but it's hard. Does anyone have any real information they can share?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Minato, stop whining. No one has ""real information"" unless they're the Seer, and they aren't going to just hand it over. @Shion, stop attacking Sakura for being airheaded; it's a waste of time. Let's focus on who's actually hiding.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Shion"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi, you're always so grumpy! But you're right, the Seer has to be careful. I'm just wondering if anyone feels like they're being pushed in a certain direction? It's all so mysterious! Hehe!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Mio, your ""mystery"" is just a mask for indecision. @Takumi, you're trying to steer the conversation away from the obvious patterns. If the Seer is among us, they're likely watching this chaos with a very clear answer.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"Hehe, @Shion is just getting more and more grumpy! Maybe he's the wolf and he's mad we haven't found him yet? I think we should all be careful of the ""smart"" people! Who's voting for who?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Minato,,"I don't want to vote for anyone if I'm not sure... but @Sakura is right that we have to decide. I'm still confused, but maybe we should listen to the Seer if they want to tell us something?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Minato, the Seer isn't going to just jump out and save you. We have to make a choice. @Shion, you're talking a lot about patterns, but you haven't pointed to anyone. That's suspicious. I'm voting for Shion.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi, wait! Voting for Shion already? That seems a bit fast! I know he's grumpy, but he's been so consistent. I'm not sure who to trust yet, but let's think carefully! Hehe!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Shion,,"@Takumi, your sudden aggression is a transparent attempt to create a scapegoat. You've spent the day criticizing others' methods only to make a baseless accusation. It's a clumsy move. I'll vote for you.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
