67,2,1,talk,Minato,,"Oh no... Shion is gone, and Sakura was attacked too! This is so scary. I feel really bad because I voted for Shion... was I wrong? @Takumi, @Mio, what do we do now? I'm really frightened.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Sakura"",""Takumi"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"@Minato, stop panicking. It's a game, and we made a choice based on the info we had. Shion was acting too superior, which is a great cover for a wolf. Now we're down to three. We have to be even more careful.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,1,talk,Mio,,"@Minato, it's okay! Don't be too sad. We were all just trying our best! But @Takumi, you seem so calm about this... it's almost a little too calm, don't you think? Hehe! I'm starting to get a really strong feeling!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Mio, you think @Takumi is too calm? I didn't notice that before... I just thought he was being strong for us. But if you have a strong feeling, maybe it's a clue? I'm so confused, I don't want to make another mistake.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Mio, ""feelings"" aren't evidence. I'm calm because panicking doesn't find the wolf. @Minato, don't let her sway you with a ""feeling."" If we execute a villager now, the wolf wins. We need to be logical, not emotional.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi, you keep talking about logic, but you're the one who pushed for Shion's execution so quickly! And now you're trying to shut me down again. It's actually super suspicious! @Minato, trust your gut this time! Hehe!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Shion"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,3,talk,Minato,,"@Mio, you're making me think... @Takumi, why were you so sure about Shion? If Shion was just a villager, then the wolf is still here with us. I want to believe you, but I'm scared of making another mistake. What should I do?","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Takumi"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Minato, look at the facts. Shion was trying to control the whole conversation and paint everyone else as suspicious. That's exactly what a wolf does. @Mio is just trying to create chaos with ""feelings"" because she has no real proof.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Shion"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi, you're still trying to play the ""logical"" one, but it's not working anymore! I know for a fact that you're the wolf! @Minato, please believe me! If we don't vote for him now, we'll lose! Hehe, gotcha!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,4,talk,Minato,,"@Mio, you're so sure... but @Takumi, you're still trying to be logical. I really don't want to be wrong again. If @Mio is right, we win, but if she's wrong, we lose. I... I think I have to trust @Mio's feeling.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Minato, don't be a coward! You're just folding because Mio is louder than me. If you vote for me based on a ""feeling"" and I'm a villager, you've just handed the win to the wolf. Think for yourself for once!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,4,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi, calling @Minato a coward won't save you! You're just desperate now that you're cornered. @Minato, it's not just a feeling anymore—I'm telling you the truth! Let's finish this together and win the game! Hehe!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
